    {
      "id": "jsonplaceholder",
      "name": "JSONPlaceholder",
      "description": {
        "it": "API finta per provare GET, POST, PUT, PATCH e DELETE: post, commenti e utenti. Le scritture rispondono come se fossero andate a buon fine, ma non salvano nulla.",
        "en": "Fake API to try GET, POST, PUT, PATCH and DELETE: posts, comments and users. Writes answer as if they succeeded but save nothing.",
        "fr": "API factice pour essayer GET, POST, PUT, PATCH et DELETE : posts, commentaires et utilisateurs. Les écritures répondent comme si elles avaient réussi, sans rien enregistrer.",
        "es": "API falsa para probar GET, POST, PUT, PATCH y DELETE: posts, comentarios y usuarios. Las escrituras responden como si hubieran funcionado, pero no guardan nada.",
        "de": "Fake-API zum Testen von GET, POST, PUT, PATCH und DELETE: Posts, Kommentare und Benutzer. Schreibvorgänge antworten erfolgreich, speichern aber nichts."
      },
      "author": {
        "name": "ForceKIT",
        "url": "https://pellegrinoluigi.github.io/creativeapp/forcekit/"
      },
      "official": true,
      "category": "test",
      "tags": [
        "REST",
        "JSON",
        "CRUD"
      ],
      "site": "https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "date": "2026-10-28",
      "compatibility": {
        "minExtensionVersion": "7.7.8"
      },
      "vars": [
        {
          "k": "JP_URL",
          "v": "https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com"
        },
        {
          "k": "postId",
          "v": "1"
        }
      ],
      "requests": [
        {
          "id": "posts",
          "name": "List posts",
          "url": "{{JP_URL}}/posts",
          "params": [
            {
              "k": "_limit",
              "v": "5",
              "on": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "post",
          "name": "Get post",
          "url": "{{JP_URL}}/posts/{{postId}}"
        },
        {
          "id": "comments",
          "name": "Comments of a post",
          "url": "{{JP_URL}}/comments",
          "params": [
            {
              "k": "postId",
              "v": "{{postId}}",
              "on": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "create",
          "name": "Create post",
          "method": "POST",
          "url": "{{JP_URL}}/posts",
          "bodyType": "json",
          "body": "{\n  \"title\": \"ForceKIT\",\n  \"body\": \"Hello from ForceKIT\",\n  \"userId\": 1\n}"
        },
        {
          "id": "update",
          "name": "Update post",
          "method": "PUT",
          "url": "{{JP_URL}}/posts/{{postId}}",
          "bodyType": "json",
          "body": "{\n  \"id\": 1,\n  \"title\": \"Updated\",\n  \"body\": \"New text\",\n  \"userId\": 1\n}"
        },
        {
          "id": "patch",
          "name": "Patch post",
          "method": "PATCH",
          "url": "{{JP_URL}}/posts/{{postId}}",
          "bodyType": "json",
          "body": "{\n  \"title\": \"Only the title\"\n}"
        },
        {
          "id": "delete",
          "name": "Delete post",
          "method": "DELETE",
          "url": "{{JP_URL}}/posts/{{postId}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "httpbin",
      "name": "httpbin",
      "description": {
        "it": "Rimanda indietro quello che riceve: header, parametri, corpo. Utile per controllare cosa parte davvero, provare l'autenticazione Basic e Bearer, codici di stato, ritardi e immagini.",
        "en": "Echoes back what it receives: headers, parameters, body. Handy to check what is really sent and to try Basic and Bearer auth, status codes, delays and images.",
        "fr": "Renvoie ce qu'il reçoit : en-têtes, paramètres, corps. Pratique pour vérifier ce qui part vraiment et tester l'authentification Basic et Bearer, les codes d'état, les délais et les images.",
        "es": "Devuelve lo que recibe: cabeceras, parámetros, cuerpo. Útil para comprobar lo que se envía de verdad y probar la autenticación Basic y Bearer, códigos de estado, retrasos e imágenes.",
        "de": "Gibt zurück, was ankommt: Header, Parameter, Body. Praktisch, um zu prüfen, was wirklich gesendet wird, und Basic- und Bearer-Authentifizierung, Statuscodes, Verzögerungen und Bilder zu testen."
      },
      "author": {
        "name": "ForceKIT",
        "url": "https://pellegrinoluigi.github.io/creativeapp/forcekit/"
      },
      "official": true,
      "category": "test",
      "tags": [
        "REST",
        "Auth",
        "Debug"
      ],
      "site": "https://httpbin.org",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "date": "2026-10-28",
      "compatibility": {
        "minExtensionVersion": "7.7.8"
      },
      "vars": [
        {
          "k": "HTTPBIN_URL",
          "v": "https://httpbin.org"
        }
      ],
      "requests": [
        {
          "id": "get",
          "name": "Echo GET",
          "url": "{{HTTPBIN_URL}}/get",
          "params": [
            {
              "k": "from",
              "v": "ForceKIT",
              "on": true
            },
            {
              "k": "id",
              "v": "{{$guid}}",
              "on": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "post",
          "name": "Echo POST JSON",
          "method": "POST",
          "url": "{{HTTPBIN_URL}}/post",
          "bodyType": "json",
          "body": "{\n  \"sentAt\": \"{{$isoTimestamp}}\",\n  \"n\": \"{{$randomInt}}\"\n}"
        },
        {
          "id": "form",
          "name": "Echo form",
          "method": "POST",
          "url": "{{HTTPBIN_URL}}/post",
          "bodyType": "form",
          "form": [
            {
              "k": "name",
              "v": "ForceKIT",
              "on": true
            },
            {
              "k": "kind",
              "v": "test",
              "on": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "headers",
          "name": "Request headers",
          "url": "{{HTTPBIN_URL}}/headers",
          "headers": [
            {
              "k": "X-Demo",
              "v": "ForceKIT",
              "on": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "basic",
          "name": "Basic auth (user / passwd)",
          "url": "{{HTTPBIN_URL}}/basic-auth/user/passwd",
          "auth": {
            "type": "basic",
            "user": "user",
            "pass": "passwd"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "bearer",
          "name": "Bearer token",
          "url": "{{HTTPBIN_URL}}/bearer",
          "auth": {
            "type": "bearer",
            "token": "demo-token"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "status",
          "name": "Status 418",
          "url": "{{HTTPBIN_URL}}/status/418"
        },
        {
          "id": "delay",
          "name": "Delay 2 s",
          "url": "{{HTTPBIN_URL}}/delay/2"
        },
        {
          "id": "xml",
          "name": "XML response",
          "url": "{{HTTPBIN_URL}}/xml"
        },
        {
          "id": "image",
          "name": "PNG image",
          "url": "{{HTTPBIN_URL}}/image/png"
        }
      ]
    },
