      "id": "graphql-countries",
      "name": "Countries GraphQL",
      "description": {
        "it": "API GraphQL pubblica sui paesi: la query va nel corpo JSON come in qualsiasi chiamata GraphQL (POST con query e variabili).",
        "en": "Public GraphQL API about countries: the query goes in the JSON body like any GraphQL call (POST with query and variables).",
        "fr": "API GraphQL publique sur les pays : la requête va dans le corps JSON comme pour tout appel GraphQL (POST avec query et variables).",
        "es": "API GraphQL pública sobre países: la consulta va en el cuerpo JSON como en cualquier llamada GraphQL (POST con query y variables).",
        "de": "Öffentliche GraphQL-API zu Ländern: Die Abfrage steht im JSON-Body wie bei jedem GraphQL-Aufruf (POST mit query und variables)."
      },
      "author": {
        "name": "ForceKIT",
        "url": "https://pellegrinoluigi.github.io/creativeapp/forcekit/"
      },
      "official": true,
      "category": "dev",
      "tags": [
        "GraphQL",
        "JSON"
      ],
      "site": "https://countries.trevorblades.com",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "date": "2026-10-28",
      "compatibility": {
        "minExtensionVersion": "7.7.8"
      },
      "vars": [
        {
          "k": "countryCode",
          "v": "IT"
        }
      ],
      "requests": [
        {
          "id": "country",
          "name": "Country (query + variables)",
          "method": "POST",
          "url": "https://countries.trevorblades.com/",
          "bodyType": "json",
          "body": "{\n  \"query\": \"query ($code: ID!) { country(code: $code) { name native capital currency languages { name } } }\",\n  \"variables\": {\n    \"code\": \"{{countryCode}}\"\n  }\n}"
        },
        {
          "id": "continents",
          "name": "Continents",
          "method": "POST",
          "url": "https://countries.trevorblades.com/",
          "bodyType": "json",
          "body": "{\n  \"query\": \"{ continents { code name } }\"\n}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "soap-public",
      "name": "Public SOAP services",
      "description": {
        "it": "Servizi SOAP di esempio molto usati per le prove: numeri in lettere (DataAccess), calcolatrice (DNE Online, solo http) e informazioni sui paesi (Oorsprong). Ognuno ha il suo WSDL da importare.",
        "en": "SOAP sample services widely used for testing: numbers to words (DataAccess), calculator (DNE Online, http only) and country info (Oorsprong). Each has its own WSDL to import.",
        "fr": "Services SOAP d'exemple très utilisés pour les tests : nombres en lettres (DataAccess), calculatrice (DNE Online, http uniquement) et infos pays (Oorsprong). Chacun a son WSDL à importer.",
        "es": "Servicios SOAP de ejemplo muy usados para pruebas: números en letras (DataAccess), calculadora (DNE Online, solo http) e información de países (Oorsprong). Cada uno tiene su WSDL para importar.",
        "de": "Viel genutzte SOAP-Beispieldienste zum Testen: Zahlen in Worten (DataAccess), Taschenrechner (DNE Online, nur http) und Länderinfos (Oorsprong). Jeder hat eine eigene WSDL zum Importieren."
      },
      "author": {
        "name": "ForceKIT",
        "url": "https://pellegrinoluigi.github.io/creativeapp/forcekit/"
      },
      "official": true,
      "category": "soap",
      "tags": [
        "SOAP 1.1",
        "XML"
      ],
      "site": "https://www.dataaccess.com/webservicesserver/NumberConversion.wso",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "date": "2026-10-28",
      "compatibility": {
        "minExtensionVersion": "7.7.8"
      },
      "vars": [
        {
          "k": "number",
          "v": "42"
        },
        {
          "k": "countryCode",
          "v": "IT"
        }
      ],
      "requests": [
        {
          "id": "words",
          "name": "NumberToWords",
          "kind": "soap",
          "url": "https://www.dataaccess.com/webservicesserver/NumberConversion.wso",
          "body": "<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<soapenv:Envelope xmlns:soapenv=\"http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/\" xmlns:web=\"http://www.dataaccess.com/webservicesserver/\">\n  <soapenv:Header></soapenv:Header>\n  <soapenv:Body>\n    <web:NumberToWords>\n      <web:ubiNum>{{number}}</web:ubiNum>\n    </web:NumberToWords>\n  </soapenv:Body>\n</soapenv:Envelope>"
        },
        {
          "id": "dollars",
          "name": "NumberToDollars",
          "kind": "soap",
          "url": "https://www.dataaccess.com/webservicesserver/NumberConversion.wso",
          "body": "<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<soapenv:Envelope xmlns:soapenv=\"http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/\" xmlns:web=\"http://www.dataaccess.com/webservicesserver/\">\n  <soapenv:Header></soapenv:Header>\n  <soapenv:Body>\n    <web:NumberToDollars>\n      <web:dNum>{{number}}.50</web:dNum>\n    </web:NumberToDollars>\n  </soapenv:Body>\n</soapenv:Envelope>"
        },
        {
          "id": "add",
          "name": "Calculator · Add",
          "kind": "soap",
          "url": "http://www.dneonline.com/calculator.asmx",
          "body": "<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<soapenv:Envelope xmlns:soapenv=\"http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/\" xmlns:tem=\"http://tempuri.org/\">\n  <soapenv:Header></soapenv:Header>\n  <soapenv:Body>\n    <tem:Add>\n      <tem:intA>{{number}}</tem:intA>\n      <tem:intB>8</tem:intB>\n    </tem:Add>\n  </soapenv:Body>\n</soapenv:Envelope>",
          "soapAction": "http://tempuri.org/Add"
        },
        {
          "id": "capital",
          "name": "CountryInfo · CapitalCity",
          "kind": "soap",
          "url": "http://webservices.oorsprong.org/websamples.countryinfo/CountryInfoService.wso",
          "body": "<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<soapenv:Envelope xmlns:soapenv=\"http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/\" xmlns:web=\"http://www.oorsprong.org/websamples.countryinfo\">\n  <soapenv:Header></soapenv:Header>\n  <soapenv:Body>\n    <web:CapitalCity>\n      <web:sCountryISOCode>{{countryCode}}</web:sCountryISOCode>\n    </web:CapitalCity>\n  </soapenv:Body>\n</soapenv:Envelope>"
        },
        {
          "id": "currency",
          "name": "CountryInfo · CountryCurrency",
          "kind": "soap",
          "url": "http://webservices.oorsprong.org/websamples.countryinfo/CountryInfoService.wso",
          "body": "<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<soapenv:Envelope xmlns:soapenv=\"http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/\" xmlns:web=\"http://www.oorsprong.org/websamples.countryinfo\">\n  <soapenv:Header></soapenv:Header>\n  <soapenv:Body>\n    <web:CountryCurrency>\n      <web:sCountryISOCode>{{countryCode}}</web:sCountryISOCode>\n    </web:CountryCurrency>\n  </soapenv:Body>\n</soapenv:Envelope>"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
